---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Why we moved to a four-day week">
  <article>
    <h1>Why we moved to a four-day week</h1>
    <p>
      <time datetime="2026-11-02">2 November 2026</time>
    </p>
    <p>
      Six months ago we switched the whole team to a four-day week. We expected a dip in output. It
      never came.
    </p>
    <p>
      Fewer days made us protective of our time. Meetings got shorter, and most of them turned into
      written updates that people read when it suited them.
    </p>
    <p>
      We're not going back. If you're thinking about trying it, start with a three-month trial and
      measure what matters to your customers.
    </p>
  </article>
</Layout>
